      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For an earlier arrival among these award options, J63 reaches Bangkok before the two later-arriving alternatives. Its trade-off is a separate SFO–LAX cash leg and LAX–Istanbul–Bangkok Turkish award itinerary; the transfer is unverified, so don’t treat the connection as protected. The award is reported in business class, but cabin by leg, taxes, seat availability and full price are unknown.",
